      "asvs_ids": [
        "v5.0.0-14.2.7"
      ],
      "findings": [
        "delete-account performs UPDATE (soft-delete) on public.users, not a hard DELETE. Schema-defined ON DELETE CASCADE/SET NULL foreign keys (ai_twin_memory, notification_prefs, referral edges, deposit/withdraw records, mission accrual, kyc_decision_audit, the sessions row itself, etc.) never fire because the parent row is never removed. Only users.email/phone_e164 are nulled plus sessions revoked. KYC document retention (5y, compliance.types.ts KYC_RETENTION_YEARS_DEFAULT, section 42.2.1) is explicit documented policy and is NOT counted as a finding here."
      ],
